; Three cards a segment in (pc, kind, n), one out: c, how many of the segment's frames are its closure. All of a
; pause's; all but the last of a stop's (the last is the burst); of an affricate's, (n CINH + CTOT / 2) / CTOT, at
; least 1 and at most n - 1, with CINH (the closure's inherent ms) and CTOT (closure and frication's) from the
; table (OUT at ask); none of anything else. The division is n steps of adding CINH and taking away CTOT.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-27: a segment: a pause, a stop
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    INP   n
  06                    CLA   z
  07                    STO   c
  08                    CLA   kind
  09                    SUB   c8
  10                    TAC   nap
  11                    CLA   n
  12                    STO   c
  13                    JMP   out
  14            nap     CLA   kind
  15                    SUB   n4
  16                    TAC   out
  17                    SUB   00
  18                    TAC   stop
  19                    SUB   00
  20                    TAC   out
  21                    SUB   00
  22                    TAC   ask
  23                    JMP   out
  24            stop    CLA   n
  25                    SUB   00
  26                    STO   c
  27                    JMP   out
  28            ask     OUT   pc       28-81: an affricate
  29            gci     INP   cinh
  30            gct     INP   ctot
  31                    CLA   ctot
  32                    ADD   ctot
  33                    ADD   ctot
  34                    ADD   ctot
  35                    ADD   ctot
  36                    SFT   01
  37                    STO   rem
  38                    CLA   n
  39                    STO   i
  40            lp      CLA   i
  41                    SUB   00
  42                    TAC   clamp
  43                    STO   i
  44                    CLA   rem
  45                    ADD   cinh
  46                    STO   rem
  47            wl      CLA   rem
  48                    SUB   ctot
  49                    TAC   lp
  50                    STO   rem
  51                    CLA   c
  52                    ADD   00
  53                    STO   c
  54                    JMP   wl
  55            clamp   CLA   c
  56                    SUB   00
  57                    TAC   c1
  58                    JMP   cmax
  59            c1      CLA   00
  60                    STO   c
  61            cmax    CLA   n
  62                    SUB   00
  63                    SUB   c
  64                    TAC   cn
  65                    JMP   out
  66            cn      CLA   n
  67                    SUB   00
  68                    STO   c
  69            out     OUT   c
  70                    JMP   rec
  71            pc      DATA  0
  72            kind    DATA  0
  73            n       DATA  0
  74            c       DATA  0
  75            cinh    DATA  0
  76            ctot    DATA  0
  77            rem     DATA  0
  78            i       DATA  0
  79            z       DATA  0
  80            c8      DATA  8
  81            n4      DATA  4
